Usage:
  nucleus seed [flags]

Execute the .sql seed files of --seeds in name order, or one file with --file. Production runs need --force or --yes.

Flags:
  -config string
    	Path to nucleus config file
  -database string
    	Database alias to use (defaults to database_default)
  -dry-run
    	Print seed execution plan without running SQL
  -file string
    	Run a single seed file (absolute path or relative to --seeds)
  -force
    	Force seed execution in production/CI
  -seeds string
    	Directory containing .sql seed files (default "seeds")
  -yes
    	Auto-confirm seed execution without prompt

Examples:
  nucleus seed --config nucleus.yml --dry-run
  nucleus seed --config nucleus.yml --file 001_users.sql
